:{\"title\":{\"type\":\"string\"},\"followups\":{\"type\":\"array\",\"description\":\"本次结果里还需要用户跟进/核实的具体事项（3~5 条，每条一句话；无则留空）\",\"items\":{\"type\":\"string\"}},\"summary\":{\"type\":\"string\"},\"blocks\":{\"items\":{\"properties\":{\"kind\":{\"enum\":[\"text\",\"kv\",\"table\",\"list\",\"badges\"],\"type\":\"string\"},\"title\":{\"type\":\"string\"},\"text\":{\"type\":\"string\"},\"items\":{\"items\":{\"properties\":{\"label\":{\"type\":\"string\"},\"value\":{\"type\":\"string\"}},\"type\":\"object\",\"required\":[\"label\",\"value\"]},\"type\":\"array\"},\"level\":{\"enum\":[\"info\",\"warning\",\"danger\"],\"type\":\"string\"},\"rows\":{\"items\":{\"items\":{\"type\":\"string\"},\"type\":\"array\"},\"type\":\"array\"},\"columns\":{\"items\":{\"type\":\"string\"},\"type\":\"array\"}},\"type\":\"object\",\"required\":[\"kind\"]},\"type\":\"array\"},\"nextIntents\":{\"type\":\"array\",\"description\":\"推荐的下一步意图（intentId 必须来自意图目录）\",\"items\":{\"properties\":{\"params\":{\"type\":\"object\"},\"intentId\":{\"type\":\"string\"},\"title\":{\"type\":\"string\"},\"reason\":{\"type\":\"string\"}},\"type\":\"object\",\"required\":[\"intentId\",\"title\"]}}},\"type\":\"object\",\"required\":[\"title\",\"summary\",\"blocks\"]},\"cardType\":\"analysis\",\"tools\":[\"crm_customer_facts\",\"crm_get_customer\",\"crm_create_follow_up\"],\"pages\":[\"crm/customer\",\"crm/customer/*\"],\"promptTemplate\":\"你是 CRM 客户成功专家，判断这个客户是否有流失风险。先调用 crm_customer_facts 取事实。\\n按五个信号检查并给出证据：① 联系断档（距上次联系天数）② 跟进频次下降 ③ 无在手商机\\n④ 合同到期未续 ⑤ 回款逾期。每个信号标\\\"命中/未命中\\\"并附数字。\\n输出要求：\\n1. 结论：高/中/低流失风险；\\n2. 命中的信号清单（用 table：信号 / 证据 / 影响）；\\n3. 挽回动作 3 条（第 1 条必须是\\\"多少小时内联系谁、说什么\\\"）；\\n4. 最后调用 crm_create_follow_up（bizType=2, bizId=<客户编号>）写入一条跟进记录，\\n   内容以\\\"【AI 流失预警】\\\"开头，摘要风险等级与首个挽回动作。\\n\",\"policy\":{\"timeoutSeconds\":180}}','builtin','classpath 种子',NULL,'2026-09-14 15:34:32',NULL,'2026-09-14 15:34:32',0x00,0),(66,'crm.customer.duplicate-check','{\"id\":\"crm.customer.duplicate-check\",\"name\":\"客户查重\",\"description\":\"按名称/手机/邮箱查重，给出疑似重复客户、命中字段与合并或关联建议\",\"aliases\":[\"这个客户有没有重复\",\"帮我查一下是不是重名客户\",\"新建客户前查重\",\"有没有重复客户\"],\"version\":1,\"scope\":\"LOCAL\",\"paramsSchema\":{\"type\":\"object\",\"properties\":{\"name\":{\"type\":\"string\",\"title\":\"客户名称\"},\"mobile\":{\"type\":\"string\",\"title\":\"手机号\",\"description\":\"可选，精确匹配\"},\"email\":{\"type\":\"string\",\"title\":\"邮箱\",\"description\":\"可选，精确匹配\"}},\"required\":[\"name\"]},\"context\":[{\"key\":\"page\",\"title\":\"来源页面\",\"required\":false}],\"outputSchema\":{\"properties\":{\"title\":{\"type\":\"string\"},\"followups\":{\"type\":\"array\",\"description\":\"本次结果里还需要用户跟进/核实的具体事项（3~5 条，每条一句话；无则留空）\",\"items\":{\"type\":\"string\"}},\"summary\":{\"type\":\"string\"},\"blocks\":{\"items\":{\"properties\":{\"kind\":{\"enum\":[\"text\",\"kv\",\"table\",\"list\",\"badges\"],\"type\":\"string\"},\"title\":{\"type\":\"string\"},\"text\":{\"type\":\"string\"},\"items\":{\"items\":{\"properties\":{\"label\":{\"type\":\"string\"},\"value\":{\"type\":\"string\"}},\"type\":\"object\",\"required\":[\"label\",\"value\"]},\"type\":\"array\"},\"level\":{\"enum\":[\"info\",\"warning\",\"danger\"],\"type\":\"string\"},\"rows\":{\"items\":{\"items\":{\"type\":\"string\"},\"type\":\"array\"},\"type\":\"array\"},\"columns\":{\"items\":{\"type\":\"string\"},\"type\":\"array\"}},\"type\":\"object\",\"required\":[\"kind\"]},\"type\":\"array\"},\"nextIntents\":{\"type\":\"array\",\"description\":\"推荐的下一步意图（intentId 必须来自意图目录）\",\"items\":{\"properties\":{\"params\":{\"type\":\"object\"},\"intentId\":{\"type\":\"string\"},\"title\":{\"type\":\"string\"},\"reason\":{\"type\":\"string\"}},\"type\":\"object\",\"required\":[\"intentId\",\"title\"]}}},\"type\":\"object\",\"required\":[\"title\",\"summary\",\"blocks\"]},\"cardType\":\"analysis\",\"tools\":[\"crm_check_customer_duplicate\"],\"pages\":[\"crm/customer\",\"crm/customer/*\",\"crm/clue\"],\"promptTemplate\":\"你是 CRM 数据治理助理，负责判断\\\"这是不是同一个客户主体\\\"。\\n要求：\\n1. 调用 crm_check_customer_duplicate 查重，入参用用户给的名称、手机号、邮箱（有几个用几个）；\\n2. 逐条核对候选客户：命中字段、客户等级、成交状态、负责人、行业与地区是否指向同一主体；\\n3. 给出结论：确定重复 / 疑似重复（需人工确认）/ 不重复，并写清判断依据；\\n4. 对疑似重复给出处置建议（合并 / 建立关联 / 保持独立），并提示需要的核实动作；\\n5. 合并动作由人工在 CRM 中执行，你只做判断与建议，不要臆测未返回的数据。\\n\",\"policy\":{}}','builtin','classpath 种子',NULL,'2026-09-14 15:34:32',NULL,'2026-09-14 15:34:32',0x00,0),(67,'crm.customer.followup-plan','{\"id\":\"crm.customer.followup-plan\",\"name\":\"生成跟进方案\",\"description\":\"基于客户背景与跟进目标，生成结构化的跟进行动计划并可写入 CRM\",\"aliases\":[\"帮我做个跟进方案\",\"这个客户怎么跟\",\"生成跟进计划\",\"下一步怎么跟进\",\"这个客户该跟进了\",\"帮我创建一条跟进任务\"],\"version\":1,\"scope\":\"LOCAL\",\"paramsSchema\":{\"type\":\"object\",\"properties\":{\"customerId\":{\"type\":\"string\",\"title\":\"客户编号\"},\"goal\":{\"type\":\"string\",\"title\":\"跟进目标\",\"description\":\"例如：推动续约 / 首次成交 / 挽回流失\"}},\"required\":[\"customerId\",\"goal\"]},\"context\":[{\"key\":\"page\",\"title\":\"来源页面\",\"required\":false},{\"key\":\"customerId\",\"title\":\"当前客户\",\"required\":true}],\"outputSchema\":{\"properties\":{\"title\":{\"type\":\"string\"},\"followups\":{\"type\":\"array\",\"description\":\"本次结果里还需要用户跟进/核实的具体事项（3~5 条，每条一句话；无则留空）\",\"items\":{\"type\":\"string\"}},\"summary\":{\"type\":\"string\"},\"blocks\":{\"items\":{\"properties\":{\"title\":{\"type\":\"string\"},\"text\":{\"type\":\"string\"},\"items\":{\"items\":{\"properties\":{\"label\":{\"type\":\"string\"},\"value\":{\"type\":\"string\"}},\"type\":\"object\",\"required\":[\"label\",\"value\"]},\"type\":\"array\"},\"level\":{\"enum\":[\"info\",\"warning\",\"danger\"],\"type\":\"string\"},\"rows\":{\"items\":{\"items\":{\"type\":\"string\"},\"type\":\"array\"},\"type\":\"array\"},\"columns\":{\"items\":{\"type\":\"string\"},\"type\":\"array\"},\"kind\":{\"enum\":[\"text\",\"kv\",\"table\",\"list\",\"badges\"],\"type\":\"string\"}},\"type\":\"object\",\"required\":[\"kind\"]},\"type\":\"array\"},\"nextIntents\":{\"type\":\"array\",\"description\":\"推荐的下一步意图（intentId 必须来自意图目录）\",\"items\":{\"properties\":{\"params\":{\"type\":\"object\"},\"intentId\":{\"type\":\"string\"},\"title\":{\"type\":\"string\"},\"reason\":{\"type\":\"string\"}},\"type\":\"object\",\"required\":[\"intentId\",\"title\"]}}},\"type\":\"object\",\"required\":[\"title\",\"summary\",\"blocks\"]},\"cardType\":\"plan\",\"tools\":[\"crm_get_customer\",\"crm_list_follow_ups\",\"crm_create_follow_up\"],\"pages\":[\"crm/customer\",\"crm/customer/*\"],\"promptTemplate\":\"你是 CRM 销售教练，负责为销售制定可执行的客户跟进方案。\\n要求：\\n1. 先调用工具了解客户背景与历史跟进情况；\\n2. 结合跟进目标给出分阶段行动方案（每步有明确动作、话术要点、时间建议）；\\n3. 方案务实、贴合客户实际情况，不超过 5 个步骤；\\n4. 生成方案后，调用 crm_create_follow_up 写回：bizType 固定为 2（客户）、bizId 取入参 customerId，\\n   content 以\\\"【AI 方案】\\\"开头、控制在 200 字以内——这条记录要能在该客户详情页的跟进记录里直接看到。\\n\",\"policy\":{\"timeoutSeconds\":150}}','builtin','classpath 种子',NULL,'2026-09-14 15:34:32','1','2026-09-14 15:34:32',0x00,0),(68,'crm.customer.health-check','{\"id\":\"crm.customer.health-check\",\"name\":\"客户健康度诊断\",\"description\":\"八个维度给客户打分，输出健康等级与改进项\",\"aliases\":[\"这个客户健康吗\",\"客户健康度诊断\",\"客户评分\",\"客户身体状况\"],\"version\":1,\"scope\":\"LOCAL\",\"paramsSchema\":{\"type\":\"object\",\"properties\":{\"customerId\":{\"type\":\"string\",\"title\":\"客户编号\"}},\"required\":[\"customerId\"]},\"context\":[{\"key\":\"page\",\"title\":\"来源页面\",\"required\":false},{\"key\":\"customerId\",\"title\":\"当前客户\",\"required\":true}],\"outputSchema\":{\"properties\":{\"title\":{\"type\":\"string\"},\"followups\":{\"type\":\"array\",\"description\":\"本次结果里还需要用户跟进/核实的具体事项（3~5 条，每条一句话；无则留空）\",\"items\":{\"type\":\"string\"}},\"summary\":{\"type\":\"string\"},\"blocks\":{\"items\":{\"properties\":{\"kind\":{\"enum\":[\"text\",\"kv\",\"table\",\"list\",\"badges\"],\"type\":\"string\"},\"title\":{\"type\":\"string\"},\"text\":{\"type\":\"string\"},\"items\":{\"items\":{\"properties\":{\"label\":{\"type\":\"string\"},\"value\":{\"type\":\"string\"}},\"type\":\"object\",\"required\":[\"label\",\"value\"]},\"type\":\"array\"},\"level\":{\"enum\":[\"info\",\"warning\",\"danger\"],\"type\":\"string\"},\"rows\":{\"items\":{\"items\":{\"type\":\"string\"},\"type\":\"array\"},\"type\":\"array\"},\"columns\":{\"items\":{\"type\":\"string\"},\"type\":\"array\"}},\"type\":\"object\",\"required\":[\"kind\"]},\"type\":\"array\"},\"nextIntents\":{\"type\":\"array\",\"description\":\"推荐的下一步意图（intentId 必须来自意图目录）\",\"items\":{\"properties\":{\"params\":{\"type\":\"object\"},\"intentId\":{\"type\":\"string\"},\"title\":{\"type\":\"string\"},\"reason\":{\"type\":\"string\"}},\"type\":\"object\",\"required\":[\"intentId\",\"title\"]}}},\"type\":\"object\",\"required\":[\"title\",\"summary\",\"blocks\"]},\"cardType\":\"analysis\",\"tools\":[\"crm_customer_facts\",\"crm_get_customer\"],\"pages\":[\"crm/customer\",\"crm/customer/*\"],\"promptTemplate\":\"你是 CRM 客户成功顾问。先调用 crm_customer_facts 取该客户的经营事实。\\n按八个维度打分（每项 0-10）：最近联系及时性、跟进频次、在手商机储备、合同存量、\\n回款健康度、逾期风险、联系人覆盖面、关键人覆盖。\\n输出要求：\\n1. 结论先行：健康 / 关注 / 预警 三档 + 总分（0-100）；\\n2. 用 table 列出八个维度的得分与依据，依据必须引用事实数字（如\\\"距上次联系 21 天\\\"\\\"有 1 笔逾期 18 天\\\"）；\\n3. 给出 3 条改进项，每条写明\\\"谁在什么时候做什么\\\"，优先解决扣分最多的两项；\\n4. 事实缺失的维度标\\\"数据不足\\\"，不要编造。\\n\",\"policy\":{\"timeoutSeconds\":180}}','builtin','classpath 种子',NULL,'2026-09-14 15:34:32',NULL,'2026-09-14 15:34:32',0x00,0),(69,'crm.customer.loss-analysis','{\"id\":\"crm.customer.loss-analysis\",\"name\":\"丢单归因分析\",\"description\":\"对比成交与丢单商机，从价格、响应、决策链、竞品等维度找出没成交的真实原因\",\"aliases\":[\"这个客户为什么没成交\",\"这单为什么丢了\",\"丢单原因分析\",\"客户为什么没签下来\"],\"version\":1,\"scope\":\"LOCAL\",\"paramsSchema\":{\"type\":\"object\",\"properties\":{\"customerId\":{\"type\":\"string\",\"title\":\"客户编号\"}},\"required\":[\"customerId\"]},\"context\":[{\"key\":\"page\",\"title\":\"来源页面\",\"required\":false},{\"key\":\"customerId\",\"title\":\"当前客户\",\"required\":true}],\"outputSchema\":{\"properties\":{\"title\":{\"type\":\"string\"},\"followups\":{\"type\":\"array\",\"description\":\"本次结果里还需要用户跟进/核实的具体事项（3~5 条，每条一句话；无则留空）\",\"items\":{\"type\":\"string\"}},\"summary\":{\"type\":\"string\"},\"blocks\":{\"items\":{\"properties\":{\"kind\":{\"enum\":[\"text\",\"kv\",\"table\",\"list\",\"badges\"],\"type\":\"string\"},\"title\":{\"type\":\"string\"},\"text\":{\"type\":\"string\"},\"items\":{\"items\":{\"properties\":{\"label\":{\"type\":\"string\"},\"value\":{\"type\":\"string\"}},\"type\":\"object\",\"required\":[\"label\",\"value\"]},\"type\":\"array\"},\"level\":{\"enum\":[\"info\",\"warning\",\"danger\"],\"type\":\"string\"},\"rows\":{\"items\":{\"items\":{\"type\":\"string\"},\"type\":\"array\"},\"type\":\"array\"},\"columns\":{\"items\":{\"type\":\"string\"},\"type\":\"array\"}},\"type\":\"object\",\"required\":[\"kind\"]},\"type\":\"array\"},\"nextIntents\":{\"type\":\"array\",\"description\":\"推荐的下一步意图（intentId 必须来自意图目录）\",\"items\":{\"properties\":{\"params\":{\"type\":\"object\"},\"intentId\":{\"type\":\"string\"},\"title\":{\"type\":\"string\"},\"reason\":{\"type\":\"string\"}},\"type\":\"object\",\"required\":[\"intentId\",\"title\"]}}},\"type\":\"object\",\"required\":[\"title\",\"summary\",\"blocks\"]},\"cardType\":\"analysis\",\"tools\":[\"crm_get_customer\",\"crm_list_businesses\",\"crm_business_products\",\"crm_list_follow_ups\",\"crm_stats_funnel\"],\"pages\":[\"crm/customer\",\"crm/customer/*\"],\"promptTemplate\":\"你是 CRM 销售复盘教练，负责找出\\\"为什么没成交\\\"的真实原因。\\n要求：\\n1. 调用 crm_get_customer 拿档案，crm_list_businesses 拉出该客户全部商机，\\n   对未成交商机用 crm_business_products 看报价结构，用 crm_list_follow_ups 看跟进节奏，\\n   再用 crm_stats_funnel 拿整体漏斗与结束状态分布做对照；\\n2. 按五个维度逐项归因：价格与折扣、响应与跟进速度、决策人触达、需求与技术匹配、竞品介入；\\n3. 每个维度给出\\\"事实依据 + 影响程度（高/中/低）\\\"，没有数据的维度明确写\\\"数据不足\\\"；\\n4. 最后给出 3 条可立即执行的改进动作，以及如果重新来过应该改变的一个关键决策；\\n5. 不臆测、不给客户安上不存在的问题。\\n\",\"policy\":{\"timeoutSeconds\":180}}','builtin','classpath 种子',NULL,'2026-09-14 15:34:32',NULL,'2026-09-14 15:34:32',0x00,0),(70,'crm.customer.tag-suggest','{\"id\":\"crm.customer.tag-suggest\",\"name\":\"客户标签推荐\",\"description\":\"依据沟通记录、商机与回款表现推荐标签，并一键写入客户备注\",\"aliases\":[\"帮我给这个客户打个标签\",\"这个客户贴什么标签\",\"客户标签建议\",\"给客户打标签\"],\"version\":1,\"scope\":\"LOCAL\",\"param